doctype html
html(lang='en')
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    meta(name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
    meta(name='csrf-token' content=csrfToken)
    title Approved TARIC codes
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/color-theme.css')
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/taric.css')
    script(src='/js/taric-codes.js' defer)
  body
    main
      nav
        a(href='/admin/taric') TARIC classification
        |  · 
        a(href='/admin/taric/history') History and training exports
      h1 Approved TARIC codes
      p Keep one stable description_summary for each code. Approval means this code is allowed for your workflow; product classifications still need human review.
      p#status(role='status' aria-live='polite') Loading codes…
      section
        h2 Import approved codes
        p Upload a UTF-8 CSV with a taricCode column. Optional columns: headings, goods_summary, description_summary. The taric_code header is also accepted. Maximum 2 MiB / 10,000 rows. Keep codes as ten-digit text, including leading zeroes.
        p Repeated codes are combined. Conflicting text rejects the file. Existing records keep their saved descriptions and approval status; edit them below.
        label(for='csv') CSV file
        input#csv(type='file' accept='.csv,text/csv')
        button#preview(type='button') Preview import
        pre#import-preview
        button#import(type='button' disabled) Approve and import new codes
      section
        h2 Existing codes
        form#search
          label(for='prefix') Filter by code or code prefix
          input#prefix(type='text' inputmode='numeric' pattern='[0-9]{0,10}' maxlength='10')
          button(type='submit') Search
        p#empty(hidden) No matching codes. Import your CSV to create approved records.
        div#codes
        button#next(type='button' hidden) Next page
      section#editor(hidden)
        h2#edit-title Edit code
        form#edit
          label
            input#approved(type='checkbox')
            |  Approved for use
          label(for='headings') TARIC headings
          textarea#headings(rows='5' maxlength='4000')
          label(for='goods-summary') Summary of goods you classify under this code
          textarea#goods-summary(rows='3' maxlength='2000')
          label(for='description-summary') Stable description_summary for training
          textarea#description-summary(rows='3' maxlength='255')
          p Leave blank until reviewed. Registry-based training exports exclude codes without this summary. Saving changes affects future exports; downloaded exports stay unchanged.
          button#save(type='submit') Save code
